cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "Adaptive Knowledge Graph"
abstract: >-
  A local-first adaptive-learning prototype that combines a Neo4j knowledge
  graph, hybrid BM25 and vector retrieval in OpenSearch, and a local LLM served
  by Ollama to answer questions with citations and generate adaptive practice
  over OpenStax textbooks.
authors:
  - family-names: Perikov
    given-names: Konstantin
repository-code: "https://github.com/MysterionRise/adaptive-knowledge-graph"
url: "https://github.com/MysterionRise/adaptive-knowledge-graph"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - knowledge graph
  - retrieval-augmented generation
  - adaptive learning
  - local LLM
  - Neo4j
  - OpenSearch
  - education
